<title>GERMANY: Lehman says rates Preussag outperform.</title>
<headline>Lehman says rates Preussag outperform.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Wednesday it had rated shares of German engineering group Preussag AG as outperform.</p>
<p>Charles Ranunkel, engineering analyst at Lehman in London, said Lehman was initiating coverage of Preussag and had had no share recommendation for the company in the recent past.</p>
<p>&quot;Outperform&quot; is Lehman's second highest rating for a share after &quot;buy.&quot;</p>
<p>Ranunkel declined to elaborate on the share recommendation.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
